  user_1,[00:00] Hello, uh... is this Vikram from Omni Insurance?
  user_2,[00:05] Yes, hi Atharv, this is Vikram Patel speaking. How can I help you today?
  user_1,[00:12] I was just checking on my health policy... I think it’s... uh... about to expire? [sighs]
  user_2,[00:18] Let me pull up your record... one sec... [typing] ...Okay, I see policy #HP-785412, it’s set to expire on 30/09/2026.
  user_1,[00:30] Oh no, that’s today! I... I wasn’t aware. What happens now? 
  user_2,[00:38] Once it hits the expiration date, the coverage stops unless you renew. We can start a renewal now if you like.
  user_1,[00:45] Yeah, I guess I need to renew. Can you tell me the premium? 
  user_2,[00:52] The renewal premium will be $1,250 annually, same benefits. I’ll send you the renewal quote via email.